The examples in this directory are described in the userguide.

Short description
-----------------

extrudate_swell2d_c:

 Viscoelastic extrudate swell problem
 Planar flow for a differential Giesekus model
 DEVSS-G/SUPG
 Implicit bilinear terms of CE in momentum balance.
 second-order Gear time integration
 NOTE: lin_elem can be set true to use linear elements for height function

extrudate_swell2d_b, extrudate_swell2d_ba:

 Viscoelastic extrudate swell problem
 Planar flow for a b-representation differential Giesekus model
 DEVSS-G/SUPG
 Implicit bilinear terms of CE in momentum balance.
 second-order Gear time integration
 NOTE: lin_elem can be set true to use linear elements for height function
 NOTE: extrudate_swell2d_b uses nodal point level rotation reinitialization.
       extrudate_swell2d_ba uses element level rotation reinitialization.

extrudate_swell3d_c:

 Viscoelastic extrudate swell problem
 3D flow for a differential Giesekus model
 DEVSS-G/SUPG
 Implicit bilinear terms of CE in momentum balance.
 second-order Gear time integration
 cylindrical height function to describe free surface

extrudate_swell3d_b, extrudate_swell3d_ba:

 Viscoelastic extrudate swell problem
 3D flow for a b-representation differential Giesekus model
 DEVSS-G/SUPG
 Implicit bilinear terms of CE in momentum balance.
 second-order Gear time integration
 cylindrical height function to describe free surface
 NOTE: extrudate_swell3d_b uses nodal point level rotation reinitialization.
       extrudate_swell3d_ba uses element level rotation reinitialization.
